---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Source and licenses — Audivane" description="Application source, codec source and build materials, license notices and checksums for the Audivane browser preview.">
  <article class="wrap section-head prose">
    <h1>Source and licenses</h1>
    <p>The browser preview uses the same application source as this checkout. Audio is processed on your machine. Project code is MIT licensed; codec libraries, fonts and other dependencies retain their own licenses.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/sources/browser/audivane-source.tar.gz">Application source snapshot</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sources/browser/browser-codec-materials.tar.gz">Browser codec source, build scripts and license materials</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sources/browser/NOTICES.md">Codec notices</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sources/browser/SOURCE-OFFER.md">Source references and build notes</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sources/browser/SHA256SUMS.txt">SHA-256 checksums</a></li>
      <li><a href="/release.json">Preview version and source identity</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>This is a development preview, not a tagged desktop release. The <a href="/release.json">source identity</a> reports whether the build includes uncommitted changes.</p>
    <p><a href="/docs/licenses/">Read the license overview</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
